sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant FS_Py as Feature Server (Python)<br/>6566/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant FS_Go as Feature Server (Go)<br/>Configurable HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Online as Online Store<br/>(Redis / PostgreSQL)
    participant Offline as Offline Store<br/>(BigQuery / Snowflake)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant CronJob as Materialization CronJob<br/>(ose-cli)
    participant Operator as Feast Operator<br/>8081/TCP Health, 8443/TCP Metrics
    participant S3 as S3-compatible Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,Online: Flow 1: Online Feature Retrieval
        Client->>Route: POST /get-online-features<br/>HTTPS/443, CRD-configured Auth
        Route->>FS_Py: Forward request<br/>6566/TCP, CRD-configured TLS
        FS_Py->>Online: Query features<br/>TCP, Connection credentials
        Online-->>FS_Py: Feature values
        FS_Py-->>Route: JSON Response
        Route-->>Client: Feature response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over CronJob,Online: Flow 2: Feature Materialization
        CronJob->>K8sAPI: Trigger materialization<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>CronJob: Acknowledged
        FS_Py->>Offline: Read historical features<br/>HTTPS/443, Cloud credentials
        Offline-->>FS_Py: Feature data
        FS_Py->>Online: Write materialized features<br/>TCP, Connection credentials
        Online-->>FS_Py: Write confirmed
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Operator,K8sAPI: Flow 3: Operator Reconciliation
        K8sAPI->>Operator: FeatureStore CR event<br/>Watch notification
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Get OpenShift TLS profile<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: TLS config (Intermediate fallback)
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployments,<br/>Services, Routes, RBAC, CronJobs<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: Resources reconciled
    end

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note over Client,FS_Go: Flow 4: Go Feature Server (High-Performance Path)
        Client->>FS_Go: POST /get-online-features<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, TLS 1.2+ (X25519MLKEM768)
        FS_Go->>Online: Direct backend query<br/>TCP, Connection credentials
        Online-->>FS_Go: Feature values
        FS_Go-->>Client: JSON Response
    end
